class Project {
  <<frozen dataclass>>
  +Path root
  +path(relative) Path
  +bl_directory Path
  +bl_entry Path
  +prepare()
}
class Session {
  +Project project
  +dict uploads
  +dict output_directories
  +dict_or_None draft
  +dict_or_None receipt
  -Lock _state_lock
  -DirectoryPicker _picker
  -Event _closed
  -set _pending_uploads
  +upload(kind, name, source, size) dict
  +uploaded(identifier, kind) dict
  +validate(payload) dict
  +confirm(validation_id) dict
  +select_directory(kind, picker_id) dict
  +cancel_directory(picker_id) dict
  +description() dict
  +api_key_display() dict
  +cleanup()
}
class DirectoryPicker {
  -Lock _lock
  -request_id_or_None _active_id
  -Event_or_None _cancel_event
  -request_id_or_None _cancelled_id
  -bool _closed
  -Event _finished
  +select(initial, request_id) Path_or_None
  +cancel(request_id)
  +close()
}
Session --> Project : 持有外部传入的项目上下文
Session "1" *-- "1" DirectoryPicker : 会话创建并关闭
note for Session "src/asr_agent/application/session.py<br/>短锁登记与发布上传；字节接收在锁外<br/>validate与confirm持锁处理当前快照<br/>draft / receipt初始为None；配置与回执采用dict"
note for Project "src/asr_agent/tools/environment.py<br/>项目目录界定安装与运行资源的存放范围<br/>与Session是普通关联，Project可独立存在"
note for DirectoryPicker "src/asr_agent/tools/directory_picker.py<br/>独立取消信号；choose_directory函数启动窗口子进程<br/>进程是函数局部对象；Session登记返回的精确路径"
